# Channel works only from the hand: played as a land, Eiganjo taps for {W} but its damage ability is refused even with
# plenty of mana and a blocking creature available (Bot2's Ornithopter blocks Bot1's Ornithopter).

[Bot1 Deck]
Eiganjo, Seat of the Empire
Ornithopter
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Eiganjo, Seat of the Empire.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Eiganjo, Seat of the Empire.Activate(Ability: Channel)
Bot1.Battlefield.Eiganjo, Seat of the Empire.Activate(Ability: Add)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {W}
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
